 pressure is rejected at the hard cap\\\")\\n1502:  @Test(\\\"successful sessions exercise M0 flows and return resources to baseline\\\")\\n1563:  @Test(\\\"approved real relux host passes the selected libssh2 compatibility row\\\")\\n1692:  @Test(\\\"Ed25519 authenticates through the opaque external signer after host approval\\\")\\n1732:  @Test(\\\"protected-byte threshold rekeys through production KEX and preserves traffic\\\")\\n1782:  @Test(\\\"elapsed-time threshold rekeys through production KEX and preserves traffic\\\")\\n1841:  @Test(\\\"connected close retires tasks after a cancellation-ignoring socket deadline\\\")\\n1894:  @Test(\\\"mandatory metric updates reconcile with the complete available snapshot\\\")\\n2008:  @Test(\\\"all libssh2 M3 runtime surfaces report unsupported or not-reported explicitly\\\")\\n===\\n3774\\n===\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 3324,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 831,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
